LanguageData.TMM.Event.EnclavePropaganda.Text:
A crisp pre-war march cuts across every receiver in the settlement as {0} broadcasts an address on order, heritage, and purging wasteland impurities.

Inspired colonists: {1}
Disgusted colonists: {2}

LanguageData.TMM.Event.HeavenDivineOmen.Text:
Columns of silver-gold light part the clouds above your settlement as the host of {0} passes overhead. The faithful feel uplifted, while demonic blood burns with unease.

Uplifted: {1}
Unsettled: {2}
